        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-710.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-710-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH711-ZORSE-ACCEL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH712-STRIPED-MRK-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH713-ZORSE-LAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH714-715M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH715-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-710-WIT      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-710.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-710.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
